 "140": {
  "source": "Quest 24 can only be started with [[Special:MyLanguage/Potential Unlock|Potential Unlock]] at level 10, and asks for the [[Special:MyLanguage/Z Sword|Z-Sword]] and level 1 of the [[Special:MyLanguage/Ultimate|Ultimate]] skill. Both come from [[Special:MyLanguage/Old Kai|Old Kai]]'s Ultimate Challenge on the Sacred Kai Planet (see [[Special:MyLanguage/Training Minigames|Training Minigames]]).",
  "translation": "A missão 24 só pode ser iniciada com [[Special:MyLanguage/Potential Unlock|Potencial Liberado]] no nível 10, e pede a [[Special:MyLanguage/Z Sword|Espada Z]] e o nível 1 da habilidade [[Special:MyLanguage/Ultimate|Ultimate]]. Ambos vêm do Desafio Ultimate do [[Special:MyLanguage/Old Kai|Velho Kaioshin]] no Mundo Sagrado dos Kai (veja [[Special:MyLanguage/Training Minigames|Minijogos de treinamento]]).",
  "outdated": false
 },
